WEBVTT

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:00.698
If the baby book

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:00.998
is still

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.998
on your to-do list,

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.648
start here.

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.258
Pick one photo

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:03.878
from this week

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:04.488
and write down

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:04.998
what was happening

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.328
just outside the frame.

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:06.818
That's a memory

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:07.628
worth keeping.

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:08.238
Everlittle gives

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:08.668
your family

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:09.358
a private place

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:09.998
for those photos,

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.168
stories, and voices,

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:11.638
so you can build

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:12.088
their story

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:12.398
a little

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.038
at a time.
